  "content": "<p data-pid=\"tO56xrBW\">上班族零基础自学日语 10 个月（日均 2 小时）通过 N2 的路过：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"804\" data-original-token=\"v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;750&#39; height=&#39;804&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"750\" data-rawheight=\"804\" data-original-token=\"v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"750\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-daaa26a1377ca7bc3627da48f9da3d7d_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"71AorrK3\">推荐先背完<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.markji.com/deck/68cba32869028d7244ed67fb\" data-draft-title=\"開始一千五：基础日语词汇（Kaishi 1.5k）\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" data-icon-name=\"zhicon_icon_24_link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">開始一千五：基础日语词汇（Kaishi 1.5k）</a>，同时通过<a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.markji.com/deck/6a2a8d6220c7211c3334c9f7\" data-draft-title=\"看动漫学日语：零基础日语听力&amp;语法课程\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" data-icon-name=\"zhicon_icon_24_link\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">看动漫学日语：零基础日语听力&amp;语法课程</a>练练耳朵并了解基本语法。（<a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/90446\" data-draft-title=\"Yokubi 中文版\" data-draft-type=\"text-link\" data-icon-name=\"zhicon_icon_24_gallery\" class=\"internal\">Yokubi 中文版</a>这个是语法补充资料）</p><p data-pid=\"U5Fe06wu\">然后就可以把教材什么的丢一边去了。我自己是一本教材都没看完，直接一个日语大沉浸，每天下班看两集生肉。一开始可以借助日语字幕，但我建议看完十部动画后把日语字幕也关了，这样才能更好地提升日语听力能力。我目前已经看了 49 部生肉了：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-1290befb938865a368ebe22616840650_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1766\" data-rawheight=\"2618\" data-original-token=\"v2-1290befb938865a368ebe22616840650\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1766\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-1290befb938865a368ebe22616840650_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1766&#39; height=&#39;2618&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1766\" data-rawheight=\"2618\" data-original-token=\"v2-1290befb938865a368ebe22616840650\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1766\" data-original=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-1290befb938865a368ebe22616840650_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-1290befb938865a368ebe22616840650_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"H5fUyS6q\">想要提高阅读能力和词汇量，可以多读轻小说，我目前已经读了 24 本了：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3582405517449aeca91cdeb71d494187_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"3054\" data-rawheight=\"1076\" data-original-token=\"v2-3582405517449aeca91cdeb71d494187\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"3054\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3582405517449aeca91cdeb71d494187_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;3054&#39; height=&#39;1076&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"3054\" data-rawheight=\"1076\" data-original-token=\"v2-3582405517449aeca91cdeb71d494187\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"3054\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-3582405517449aeca91cdeb71d494187_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-3582405517449aeca91cdeb71d494187_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"qw2afWNS\">遇到生词就查，遇到看不懂的语法也查，都可以查，只要你装对辞典就行。我推荐初学者装一个明鏡日汉双解辞典和小学馆日中辞典，还有毎日のんびり日本語教師语法辞典。这三个辞典大约能解决初学者 90% 以上的疑惑。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-85b298fb9dfafeaa488941ebc2101953_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1328\" data-rawheight=\"1120\" data-original-token=\"v2-85b298fb9dfafeaa488941ebc2101953\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1328\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-85b298fb9dfafeaa488941ebc2101953_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1328&#39; height=&#39;1120&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1328\" data-rawheight=\"1120\" data-original-token=\"v2-85b298fb9dfafeaa488941ebc2101953\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1328\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-85b298fb9dfafeaa488941ebc2101953_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-85b298fb9dfafeaa488941ebc2101953_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-bc8cb7ea483cff8871bff67113a550a0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1526\" data-rawheight=\"496\" data-original-token=\"v2-bc8cb7ea483cff8871bff67113a550a0\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1526\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bc8cb7ea483cff8871bff67113a550a0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1526&#39; height=&#39;496&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1526\" data-rawheight=\"496\" data-original-token=\"v2-bc8cb7ea483cff8871bff67113a550a0\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1526\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-bc8cb7ea483cff8871bff67113a550a0_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-bc8cb7ea483cff8871bff67113a550a0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-308358d3cda0c078fc03bb17008a27ac_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1414\" data-rawheight=\"1676\" data-original-token=\"v2-308358d3cda0c078fc03bb17008a27ac\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1414\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-308358d3cda0c078fc03bb17008a27ac_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1414&#39; height=&#39;1676&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1414\" data-rawheight=\"1676\" data-original-token=\"v2-308358d3cda0c078fc03bb17008a27ac\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1414\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-308358d3cda0c078fc03bb17008a27ac_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-308358d3cda0c078fc03bb17008a27ac_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"nfI-nCl0\">以下是我让 AI 根据我日语自学一年的所有数据整理的报告，仅供参考：</p><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2076742638171116932\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"日语学习一周年阶段性总结报告\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6edd1d9ee84abb16641846b63218f0af.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" class=\"internal\">日语学习一周年阶段性总结报告</a><p data-pid=\"PZRRVCwD\">最完整的日语学习指南请见：</p><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//my.feishu.cn/wiki/YeOSwsG7giLuQxkcDFscUXVZn2f\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">基于二语习得理论的日语学习指南</a><p data-pid=\"wZGAsQ5G\">我平时日语学习的录播都发在 B 站上了：</p><a href=\"https://link.zhihu.com/?target=https%3A//www.bilibili.com/video/BV15kJe63E9K\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"[学日语] 读我的初恋对象接过吻了 (2026-10-17)\" data-draft-cover=\"\" class=\" wrap external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">[学日语] 读我的初恋对象接过吻了 (2026-10-17)</a><p data-pid=\"0mDyfZQF\">我还做了一些日语专项练习的小网站：</p><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/30575\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"kanabr\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e44ec3120dd158dd339ca45cd0c3906c.jpg?needBackground=1&amp;source=edda2ec7\" class=\"internal\">kanabr</a><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/project/detail/30590\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"活用道场\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-51a1967f93e53dc21111c77f20e4af27.jpg?needBackground=1&amp;source=edda2ec7\" class=\"internal\">活用道场</a><p data-pid=\"SjU9NMHW\">希望我的经验对题主或同样想要学日语的上班族有所帮助。</p>",
